# $capability_id Artifact Index Manifest Contract

## Purpose

Bind artifact index metadata to deterministic validation notes.

## Required Fields

- `artifact_index_manifest_id`
- `capability_id`
- `metadata_only`
- `artifact_index_path`
- `indexed_artifacts`
- `validation_commands`
- `remaining_blockers`

## Rules

- The manifest must point at scaffold artifacts only.
- The manifest must not assert runtime execution.
- The manifest must preserve the forbidden boundary checklist.
